{"bundle":{"value":"app\/org.gimp.GIMP\/x86_64\/stable","runtime":"org.gnome.Platform\/x86_64\/51","type":"flatpak","sdk":"org.gnome.Sdk\/x86_64\/51"},"is_eol":false,"branding":[{"value":"#f4e4cb","scheme_preference":"light","type":"primary"},{"value":"#293a56","scheme_preference":"dark","type":"primary"}],"summary":"High-end image creation and manipulation","supports":null,"releases":[{"description":"<p>GIMP 3.2.8 fixes a lot of bugs, including platform specific bugs (for instance windowing\n          bugs on macOS and Windows).<\/p>\n        ","timestamp":"1793577600","date_eol":null,"version":"3.2.8","urgency":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.gimp.org\/release\/3.2.8\/","type":"stable","date":null},{"description":"<p>This new bugfix release of GIMP 3.2 brings a whole new level of stability:<\/p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>New input axis \"Rotation\" (a.k.a. \"barrel rotation\") supported in dynamics<\/li>\n            <li>Bug fixes and usability improvements to recently added features and non-destructive workflows<\/li>\n            <li>A lot of maintenance love happened for the macOS version<\/li>\n            <li>gimptool utility can now compile GEGL operations (filters) and work better on macOS,\n            Windows and AppImage<\/li>\n            <li>Many file formats support improved<\/li>\n            <li>Various vulnerabilities fixed<\/li>\n          <\/ul>\n        ","timestamp":"1788998400","date_eol":null,"version":"3.2.6","urgency":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.gimp.org\/release\/3.2.6\/","type":"stable","date":null},{"description":"<p>The second bugfix release of the GIMP 3.2 series brings it to quite a stable state again\n          as bugs reports are slowing down.<\/p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Bug fixed where GIMP would fail to open some XCF<\/li>\n            <li>When moving a floating layer or selection with a selection tool, marching ants are now\n            disabled<\/li>\n            <li>Improved Text tool, especially regarding prioritizing global actions<\/li>\n            <li>Better temporary folder handling<\/li>\n            <li>Fill actions now behave accordingly to the target item type<\/li>\n            <li>Various file formats support improved<\/li>\n            <li>A new function and a deprecation in the libgimp API for plug-ins<\/li>\n          <\/ul>\n        ","timestamp":"1776384000","date_eol":null,"version":"3.2.4","urgency":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.gimp.org\/release\/3.2.4\/","type":"stable","date":null},{"description":"<p>Here we go! The first bugfix release for the GIMP 3.2 series is here.<\/p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>A bug when group layers became invisible in some conditions when children had effects\n            got fixed<\/li>\n            <li>More fixes, especially for the new vector and link layer types, as well as non-destructive\n            effects<\/li>\n            <li>Various file formats support improved<\/li>\n            <li>Themes fixes and improvements<\/li>\n            <li>Support for x86 (32-bit) architecture on Windows was dropped<\/li>\n          <\/ul>\n        ","timestamp":"1774656000","date_eol":null,"version":"3.2.2","urgency":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.gimp.org\/release\/3.2.2\/","type":"stable","date":null}],"translation":null,"developer_name":"The GIMP team","urls":{"help":"https:\/\/www.gimp.org\/docs\/","donation":"https:\/\/www.gimp.org\/donating\/","translate":null,"faq":null,"contact":null,"vcs_browser":"https:\/\/gitlab.gnome.org\/GNOME\/gimp\/","contribute":"https:\/\/www.gimp.org\/develop\/","bugtracker":"https:\/\/www.gimp.org\/bugs\/","homepage":"https:\/\/www.gimp.org\/"},"icon":"https:\/\/dl.flathub.org\/media\/org\/gimp\/GIMP\/800933a572869e1c8daee367dc2287cb\/icons\/128x128\/org.gimp.GIMP.png","recommends":null,"icons":[{"width":128,"height":128,"scale":null,"type":"remote","url":"https:\/\/dl.flathub.org\/media\/org\/gimp\/GIMP\/800933a572869e1c8daee367dc2287cb\/icons\/128x128\/org.gimp.GIMP.png"},{"width":128,"height":128,"scale"